    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σῐνώπη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<u>Sinope</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.76
		</span></i>, etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπεύς</span></b> ,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>an inhabitant thereof</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.3.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπίτης</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πῑ]</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				255
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπίς</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπῖτις</span></b> , ἡ, <i>the country</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.3.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.3.12
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπίς</span>, <i>a
				compound medicine</i> in Heras ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.785
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπική</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίλτος</span>), ἡ,
				<i>a red earth</i> found in Cappadocia, imported into Greece
			from Sinope, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.2.10
			</span></i>, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπίς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σινωπῖτις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				10.1180.55
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σινοπ-</span>); also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σινωπίδιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Tz.
				<u>H.</u>
				13.44
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιναπίδιον</span>.</div>
